@MyVideoGameList.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5039

### Liveness probe
GET {{MyVideoGameList.Server_HostAddress}}/healthz

### Readiness probe (database + IGDB reachability)
GET {{MyVideoGameList.Server_HostAddress}}/readyz

### Browse games
GET {{MyVideoGameList.Server_HostAddress}}/api/games?offset=0
Accept: application/json

### Search games
GET {{MyVideoGameList.Server_HostAddress}}/api/games?search=elden
Accept: application/json

### Upcoming releases
GET {{MyVideoGameList.Server_HostAddress}}/api/games/upcoming
Accept: application/json

### Active platforms
GET {{MyVideoGameList.Server_HostAddress}}/api/platforms/active
Accept: application/json

### Export everything the signed-in user has entered
# Needs the Identity cookie. Free and IGDB-free — see docs/decisions/0024-the-ownership-contract.md.
GET {{MyVideoGameList.Server_HostAddress}}/api/user/export
Accept: application/json

### Delete the signed-in user's account
# Irreversible, and it cascades to every user-owned table. The password is the confirmation.
DELETE {{MyVideoGameList.Server_HostAddress}}/api/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "your-password-here"
}
